"P953084949" "I've been doing some digging and found an abandoned office where the thugs were given what they thought was a common street drug. It was actually a Rikti mutation drug. As you know, the Rikti have been a constant nuisance to us since their failed invasion last year.<br><br>I spoke with Dr. Miller and he says he can create a cure, but we need the original formula for the mutation drug. I believe the formula is on a computer in that office. I want you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>go in there, clear out any enemies you find, and find the formula on the computer.</A>"
